WEBVTT

00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:03.596
As these pictures show,
the grieving heart in the middle

00:04:03.636 --> 00:04:06.836
looks very different
than the normal heart on the left.

00:04:06.836 --> 00:04:08.156
It appears stunned

00:04:08.196 --> 00:04:12.596
and frequently balloons into
the distinctive shape of a takotsubo,

00:04:12.636 --> 00:04:13.796
shown on the right,

00:04:13.796 --> 00:04:17.956
a Japanese pot with a wide base
and a narrow neck.

00:04:17.996 --> 00:04:20.876
We don't know exactly why this happens,

00:04:20.876 --> 00:04:23.476
and the syndrome usually resolves
within a few weeks.

00:04:23.516 --> 00:04:25.476
However, in the acute period,

00:04:25.516 --> 00:04:28.276
it can cause heart failure,

00:04:28.316 --> 00:04:30.276
life-threatening arrhythmias,